# A local `pnpm install`, or the link storybook_dev makes to the built tree;
# the checks use the npm_link_all_packages tree. Storybook's dev server also
# keeps its cache in a node_modules beside each Storybook.
# No trailing slash: the link is a file to git, not a directory.
node_modules
# The config storybook_dev generates beside each Storybook.
.tbhb-storybook/
